<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ballarat Goldfields tops turnover.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ballarat Goldfields tops turnover.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Victorian gold explorer, Ballarat Goldfields NL, topped turnover in early trade on Friday after 44.56 million shares traded.</p>
<p>With only two trades so far, the bulk of the turnover was in one line of 44.46 million shares specialled through Hartley Poynton Ltd at 7.1 cents per share.  </p>
<p>Ballarat chief executive officer Andrew Woskett told Reuters that Ballarat's major shareholder, Resolute Ltd, had sold its stake.</p>
<p>&quot;The only possibility is our major shareholder, Resolute Ltd, and they have sold to a group of Hartley Poynton clients,&quot; Woskett told Reuters.</p>
<p>--Walter Watson 61-2 9373-1810</p>
</text>
